                <pb facs="1515" n="1491" xml:id="pg1491"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">I.<hi rendition="#italic">Date and Meeting Place of the Next
                        Session of the Council of Foreign Ministers</hi></p>
                <p>It was <hi rendition="#italic">decided</hi> that the next session of the Council
                    of Foreign Ministers would commence at Moscow on March 10, 1947.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Proposal by the U.S. Delegation
                        for the Appointment of Special Deputies for the Study of Questions
                        Concerning Germany and Austria</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, a decision on this question was <hi
                        rendition="#italic">deferred</hi>.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III. <hi rendition="#italic">Agenda for the Next Session of
                        the Council of Foreign Ministers</hi></p>
                <p>(Proposals by the U.S. Delegation [CFM(46) (NY)57],<anchor n="63"
                        xml:id="d402-f1"/> the U.S.S.R. Delegation [CFM(46) (NY)60],<anchor n="64"
                        xml:id="d402-f2"/> and the French Delegation [CFM(46) (NY)63].)<anchor
                        n="65" xml:id="d402-f3"/></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views, it was <hi rendition="#italic">decided</hi> to
                    request representatives to draft the text of an agenda for the Council’s next
                    session, and to report back to the Council at its meeting on December 10th.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">IV. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>Tuesday, December 10, 1946, at 11:30 a.m.</p>
